धनं ज्ञानं जनसमर्थनं च, एतेषां संगमे सफलता वर्धते।
 मम प्रगतेः पन्थानं सर्वे मिलित्वा निर्मिमः॥

 Meaning: Wealth, knowledge, and people’s support together create success. Let us collectively build the path of growth.




 उद्यमेन हि सिद्ध्यन्ति कार्याणि न मनोरथैः।
 ज्ञानेन धनं, जनैः बलं, सततप्रयत्नेन विजयः॥


 Meaning: Success comes through effort, not merely wishes. Knowledge creates wealth, people create strength, and consistent effort brings victory.



 ज्ञानं मूलं, धनं फलम्।
 जनाः शक्तिः, प्रगतिः लक्ष्यं॥

 Meaning: Knowledge is the root, wealth is the fruit. People are the strength, growth is the goal.



 संगच्छध्वं संवदध्वं संवो मनांसि जानताम्।
 ज्ञानात् धनम्, धनात् सेवा, सेवायाः ख्यातिः, ख्यातेः प्रगतिः॥



 Meaning: Let us grow together in unity. Knowledge creates wealth, wealth enables service, service brings reputation, and reputation drives growth





